is convincing\n\nStructure your review as:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: Major/Minor)\n- Missing related work (specific papers/areas)\n- Questions for authors\n- Scores: Soundness, Excitement, Overall (with brief justification)\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Evaluate whether this paper makes a sufficient contribution for EMNLP 2026 (acceptance rate ~22-25%).","uuid":"7068ff26-f458-4c31-85e7-c9724a3012f5","session_id":"bc99c231-f3c4-48af-92ec-23a6c87c30e4"}
